# ChangeRefused refuses an uncompilable policy before the durable write.
MODULE: SchemaPolicyConfig
ROW: ChangeRefused
FILE: src/lattice.schema/LatticeSchemaPolicyStore.cs
DETECTORS: LatticeSchemaPolicyStoreTests.SetPolicyAsync_negative_max_byte_length_is_rejected_and_not_stored
SUMMARY: the store writes a policy without compiling it first

--- FIND
        _ = CompiledSchemaPolicy.Compile(policy);
--- REPLACE
        _ = policy;
--- END
